Include this platform's console keyboard headers.

The KD* requests, their structures and the key symbol definitions are the
established console keyboard interface, unchanged; on this platform they are
reached as <sys/kd.h> and <sys/keyboard.h>.  One #ifdef per include site and
nothing else changes.  kbd_mode also asks a kernel version header whether
K_OFF exists; here it always has.

